ete posting at https://au.whatjobs.com/pub_api__cpl__121389371__7084?geoID=15513\n\nSydney | Full Time | Permanent - Full Time\n\nHelp us turn data into better decisions!\n\nAt McPherson's, we're building the capability that helps our business learn faster, decide faster and work smarter. We're looking for a Data & AI Engineer to help us connect data, automate work and bring practical AI solutions into everyday business processes.\n\nThis is not a role where you'll disappear into the back room building technology for technology's sake. You'll work across the business to solve real problems. You'll build reliable data platforms, create automation that removes manual effort, develop reporting that helps people make better decisions and help bring AI into the hands of our teams.\n\nIf you enjoy turning complexity into something simple, useful and reliable, we'd like to hear from you.\n\nWhat you'll do\n\nYou'll work across data, automation and AI, including:\n\n• Building","source_board":"freehire:whatjobs-au","source_external_id":"data-ai-engineer-mcpherson-s-consumer-products-ycjka525","source_url":"https://au.whatjobs.com/pub_api__cpl__121389371__7084?geoID=15513","source_posted_at":"2026-09-04T15:53:20Z","description_is_excerpt":true,"source_group":"ai_engineer"},{"id":"319c7e4c-cf12-57ae-8de5-58e447a44e9e","company_id":"0949bc2c-81db-5947-a36f-d4f554a1f607","title":"AI Engineer | Agent Engineer (Agentic AI)","location":"Sydney, Sydney Region","job_type":"full_time","industry":"AI & Software","career_id":"ml-engineer","experience_level":"not stated","description":"JD excerpt from adzuna; read the complete posting at https://www.adzuna.com.au/details/5867201954\n\nLine of Service Advisory Industry/Sector Technology Specialism Advisory - Other Management Level Senior Associate Job Description & Summary The AI team is comprised of highly experienced designers, developers, engineers, data scientists and analysts who are responsible for delivering digital products and AI solutions to PwC's business across multiple lines of service in Australia. We partner with subject matter experts across the business to advise on, design and build agentic AI systems and LL…","source_board":"adzuna","source_external_id":"5867201954","source_url":"https://www.adzuna.com.au/details/5867201954","source_posted_at":"2026-09-03T01:27:23Z","description_is_excerpt":true,"source_group":"ai_engineer"},{"id":"a9a76adc-26e4-52eb-9c47-b9d2f6987899","company_id":"6469c916-8f27-53ce-9a8a-7fae38586bfa","title":"Power Platform Developer- AI Builder, Copilot Studio- New team","location":"The Rocks, Sydney","job_type":"full_time","industry":"AI & Software","career_id":"ml-engineer","experience_level":"not stated","description":"JD excerpt from adzuna; read the complete posting at https://www.adzuna.com.au/details/5867372340\n\nA leading independent not for profit organisation based in Sydney CBD is seeking a Power Platform Developer to join their team on a permanent basis. This is a newly created role and a great oppotrtunity to build something from scratch. The role is based in Sydney CBD and is 3 days a week in the office. 9 days worked a fortnight also This role will suit an end-to-end Power Platform Developer / Engineer who can build solutions, integrate them with Azure and Microsoft services, and also take respo…","source_board":"adzuna","source_external_id":"5867372340","source_url":"https://www.adzuna.com.au/details/5867372340","source_posted_at":"2026-09-03T02:43:58Z","description_is_excerpt":true,"source_group":"ai_engineer"},{"id":"471a4221-9c3f-5aac-ac5a-4e5bbe7da06e","company_id":"6e84e8c7-5f5c-5798-8eb6-aee1007d61f7","title":"Machine Learning Engineer","location":"Port Melbourne, Port Phillip","job_type":"full_time","industry":"AI & Software","career_id":"ml-engineer","experience_level":"not stated","description":"JD excerpt from adzuna; read the complete posting at https://www.adzuna.com.au/details/5867202325\n\nAbout the role As a Machine Learning Engineer at Arkeus, you will work with the Machine Learning team to prepare data and develop ML models, joining specialists working at the intersection of machine learning, computer vision, optical science and engineering design. Your work will be central to our image-based optical sensing technology — training, optimising and deploying models that detect and classify objects from the airborne perspective, in real time, on real hardware. You will take owners…","source_board":"adzuna","source_external_id":"5867202325","source_url":"https://www.adzuna.com.au/details/5867202325","source_posted_at":"2026-09-03T01:28:16Z","description_is_excerpt":true,"source_group":"ai_engineer"},{"id":"f2f35e6a-2a24-510b-8cfd-04a69e369701","company_id":"104ef5f1-f781-55e4-8926-aeefda680f07","title":"Associate Software Engineer, AI Team — AI Data Enrichment","location":"Sydney, Australia","job_type":"full_time","industry":"AI & Software","career_id":"ml-engineer","experience_level":"not stated","description":"JD excerpt from freehire:whatjobs-au; read the complete posting at https://au.whatjobs.com/pub_api__cpl__121343150__7084?geoID=15513\n\nNuix in Sydney invites applications for an Associate Software Engineer to join an AI team developing Enrich, our data-enrichment product. You will work with Java, Python, and React/TypeScript, guided by senior engineers, in a supportive cross-timezone team.\nThe role centers on completing scoped tasks, writing tests, and learning our SDLC and delivery practices. A base in Sydney office with a hybrid arrangement of in-office and remote work is offered.","source_board":"freehire:whatjobs-au","source_external_id":"associate-software-engineer-ai-team-ai-data-enrichment-nuix-limited-dakahxjh","source_url":"https://au.whatjobs.com/pub_api__cpl__121343150__7084?geoID=15513","source_posted_at":"2026-09-03T15:22:55Z","description_is_excerpt":true,"source_group":"ai_engineer"},{"id":"9ed353d0-1151-5735-87d8-c803a1f7f932","company_id":"776663aa-907b-5d4d-93d2-e