ies, focusing on creating scalable data solutions that add real business value.\nThe successful candidate will engage in building cloud-native data platforms, developing data pipelines on Azure, and applying responsible AI practices. Westpac offers flexible work arrangements and opportunities for learning and community engagement.","source_board":"freehire:whatjobs-au","source_external_id":"data-platform-engineer-for-ai-adoption-westpac-group-lppgokza","source_url":"https://au.whatjobs.com/pub_api__cpl__121129509__7084?geoID=2","source_posted_at":"2026-09-02T12:11:39Z","description_is_excerpt":true,"source_group":"ai_engineer"},{"id":"ba1b2d5e-a186-552d-a22a-4e6905612ae9","company_id":"a80505ec-8e2b-5808-a2a0-f4844538560e","title":"Databricks Platform Engineer, AI and Data, Technology Consulting","location":"Victoria, Australia","job_type":"full_time","industry":"AI & Software","career_id":"ml-engineer","experience_level":"not stated","description":"JD excerpt from freehire:whatjobs-au; read the complete posting at https://au.whatjobs.com/pub_api__cpl__121226262__7084?geoID=7\n\nAt EY, we’re all in to shape your future with confidence. We’ll help you succeed in a globally connected powerhouse of diverse teams and take your career wherever you want it to go. Join EY and help to build a better working world.\n\nThe opportunity\n\nAs a Databricks Platform Engineer, you will design, build and optimise scalable cloud-based data platforms that support advanced analytics, AI and data engineering workloads. Working closely with data engineers, architects, and business stakeholders, you will play a key role in enabling secure, high-performing and reliable Databricks environments that drive business outcomes. You will bring experience across modern cloud ecosystems and the Databricks Data Intelligence Platform, contributing to the design, implementation and operation of enterprise data and AI platforms. Your work will include platform configuration, automation, security, gove