 the right thing for our people, clients and communities.\n\nPeople are our greatest asset, and we offer a competitive package to retain and attract the best","source_board":"freehire:whatjobs-au","source_external_id":"artificial-intelligence-machine-learning-engineer-amentum-mrz4jsg3","source_url":"https://au.whatjobs.com/pub_api__cpl__119874652__7084?geoID=15433","source_posted_at":"2026-08-13T17:59:52Z","description_is_excerpt":true,"source_group":"ai_engineer"},{"id":"27c2b486-8301-5d5a-804f-d8ae824738c0","company_id":"4a9c0ca3-3e6e-5a8c-9f68-8680055bdc54","title":"Azure AI Engineer – Enterprise GenAI & Security","location":"Canberra, Australia","job_type":"full_time","industry":"AI & Software","career_id":"ml-engineer","experience_level":"not stated","description":"JD excerpt from freehire:whatjobs-au; read the complete posting at https://au.whatjobs.com/pub_api__cpl__119811659__7084?geoID=471\n\nMTP Services seeks an experienced AI Engineer to design, build and deploy secure enterprise AI solutions within a large Federal Government environment. You will work with architects, cyber security, data teams and stakeholders to deliver scalable AI solutions using the Microsoft Azure ecosystem.\nYou will design and develop enterprise AI solutions using Azure AI services and Microsoft technologies, build AI agents and RAG solutions, and implement governance and security across platforms.","source_board":"freehire:whatjobs-au","source_external_id":"azure-ai-engineer-enterprise-genai-security-mtp-services-j75vum3r","source_url":"https://au.whatjobs.com/pub_api__cpl__119811659__7084?geoID=471","source_posted_at":"2026-08-13T11:01:20Z","description_is_excerpt":true,"source_group":"ai_engineer"},{"id":"fa1bc398-7412-531f-994b-4a958474f206","company_id":"c8b9b2dd-09e4-58d4-b5c9-302512a448da","title":"Machine Learning Engineer (27674)","location":"Cambridge, Australia","job_type":"full_time","industry":"AI & Software","career_id":"ml-engineer","experience_level":"not stated",